From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp90: Implement GetNextAsyncId, CaptureCallstack and __set_stl_sync_api_mode.

Concurrency platform helpers: GetNextAsyncId (msvcp110's
_GetNextAsyncId, msvcp120, msvcp140), one more each call;
CaptureCallstack (msvcp140), the return addresses from its caller up
after skipping the given number of frames; __set_stl_sync_api_mode
(msvcp140), accepted for every mode as Wine's library has one
implementation of its mutexes and condition variables. msvcp120_app and
msvcp_win forward.
---
